+//! editable breadcrumb path bar, and four views over one folder (icons
+//! with real thumbnails, a sortable DataGrid list with expandable folders,
+//! a compact list, and a treemap of where the bytes actually are). Space
+//! quick-looks the selection the way macOS does; inside wm the compositor
+//! hosts that popup for us.
