+//! route as a library: the AI route/trip planner widget ([`RouteView`]) —
+//! map, assistant loop, navigation — and the module ([`module`]) a host
+//! links to seat it in-process. The standalone binary (`src/main.rs`,
+//! feature `standalone`) is the same crate with a `Window` around
+//! `RouteView{}` and the AI service port toward the desktop bus.
+//!
+//! Needs: `local/maps/*` nav data (see examples/map), ANTHROPIC_API_KEY as
+//! env var or a file of that name at the repo root. Run from the repo root.
+
+pub use ::makepad_widgets;
